===Jamaica vs Croatia===
To date, this is the last match in which both sides were playing their first ever FIFA World Cup fixture.  It was the first time it had happened since [[1974 FIFA World Cup|1974]], when [[East Germany national football team|East Germany]] played [[Australia men's national soccer team|Australia]].

